+# Cache eviction policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use an LRU (least-recently-used) cache with a fixed 300-second TTL. The choice was made because a fixed TTL window combined with least-recently-used eviction gives predictable behavior and is cleaner and easier to reason about.
